  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Bot or no bot?",
      "body": [
        "Most AI note takers send a bot into your Zoom, Google Meet or Teams call, and everyone in the call sees it join.",
        "Granola never uses a bot: it records your computer's or phone's audio. Otter.ai, Fireflies.ai and tl;dv default to a bot but also offer Mac and Windows desktop apps that record without one. Fathom's bot-free mode is Mac only and still in beta. Whichever you use, tell people when a call is being recorded."
      ],
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Granola: no bot, device audio on all plans",
          "source": "https://www.granola.ai/",
          "checked": "2026-10-23",
          "confirmed": true
        },
        {
          "text": "Otter.ai: desktop app records without a bot",
          "source": "https://help.otter.ai/hc/en-us/articles/35973988280215-Otter-Desktop-App-Mac-Windows",
          "checked": "2026-10-23",
          "confirmed": true
        },
        {
          "text": "Fireflies.ai: desktop app records without a bot",
          "source": "https://guide.fireflies.ai/articles/6666374717-how-to-record-meetings-without-a-bot-on-the-fireflies-desktop-app",
          "checked": "2026-10-23",
          "confirmed": true
        },
        {
          "text": "tl;dv: desktop app records with or without a bot",
          "source": "https://intercom.help/tldv/en/articles/14433922-record-meetings-on-any-platform-with-or-without-a-bot-tl-dv-desktop-app",
          "checked": "2026-10-23",
          "confirmed": true
        },
        {
          "text": "Fathom: bot-free capture is Mac only and in beta",
